<view class="container pt-safe">
  <view class="mt-8 text-center text-xl text-gray-400">
    请求调用、unocss、static图片
  </view>
  <view class="my-2 text-center">
    <image src="https://nuanxin-images-1329191669.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/avatar.jpg" class="h-100px w-100px" />
  </view>
  <view class="my-2 text-center text-sm">
    当前是否登录：{{ hasLogin }}
  </view>
  <view class="m-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
    <button class="w-40 text-center" bindtap="gotoLogin">
      点击去登录页
    </button>
    <button class="w-40 text-center" bindtap="logout">
      点击退出登录
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="mt-8 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm mx-4">
    <view class="font-bold mb-2">模拟数据演示</view>
    <view class="text-xs text-gray-500">模拟接口请求返回的数据如下：</view>
    <view class="mt-2 text-xs bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded">
      {{ mockResult }}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-gray-400 px-8">
    为了方便脚手架动态生成不同UI模板，本页的按钮统一使用UI库无关的原生button
  </view>
  <view class="h-10" />
</view>
